<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 94,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 94,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's actual receipts 94,000 at interior Iowa Minnesota. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts traded steady to firm compared with mid-session Monday. Top $58.50 per cwt.</p>
